WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.270
Address

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:03.270
What's that?

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:09.450
A safe house.. in Paris. Why would I need a safe house in Paris? Should things at some point go terribly wrong?

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:13.200
It's good to have a place to go... you know ... for a cup of tea

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.710
My brothers...

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.909
My sisters, the clock is ticking faster

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:29.249
My dream, we who live for truth, for love

00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:30.790
Nagini

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:35.040
The moment has come to take our rightful place

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.300
in the world

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.220
where we Wizards

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.220
were free

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.450
Join me

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:53.259
Or Die. The Wizarding and non-Wizarding worlds have been at peace for over a century

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.809
Grindelwald wants to see that peace destroyed

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.309
You want me to hunt him down

00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:08.309
to kill him.

00:01:10.549 --> 00:01:11.400
Dumbledore, why can't you go?

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:13.920
I cannot move against Grindelwald.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.589
It has to be you

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.400
You don't suffer from motion sickness do you?

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.859
I don't do well on boats. You'll be fine.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:34.280
Do you know why I admire you Nick? You do not seek power

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.929
You simply ask is the thing... right?

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.580
The time is coming

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.890
When you're going to have to pick a side

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.800
No I don't do sides.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.419
What are you gonna do?

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.420
I'll think of something.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.000
Newt, you never met a monster you couldn't love.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.160
Let's take him.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.780
That's your brother?

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:22.580
I think that might have been the best moment of my life

